WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.291
Welbuk — one connected platform for clinics and hospitals.

2
00:00:06.311 --> 00:00:08.891
Welbuk Practice runs the clinic.

3
00:00:08.911 --> 00:00:11.815
Welbuk Care supports the whole team.

4
00:00:11.835 --> 00:00:15.590
Welbuk Health connects patients and families.

5
00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:23.516
Online booking, doctor schedules, slot allocation, walk-ins — every appointment in one place.

6
00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.747
Live queue: Prior, Walk-in, Emergency.

7
00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:33.687
Urgent patients get priority; changes reach the team instantly.

8
00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:38.712
Scan the QR to register, digital consent, ABHA link.

9
00:00:38.732 --> 00:00:43.717
Or check in with help at reception — straight into the queue.

10
00:00:44.088 --> 00:00:47.433
Welbuk Care: a separate work screen for everyone.

11
00:00:47.453 --> 00:00:54.008
The nurse records vitals, the doctor gets the consultation queue, the team gets notifications.

12
00:00:54.388 --> 00:01:02.248
Every consultation starts with the full picture: history, allergies, vitals, SOAP notes.

13
00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:11.330
With consent, Care Scribe transcribes the conversation, separates the speakers and drafts the summary, prescription and follow-up.

14
00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:13.943
The doctor signs only after checking.

15
00:01:14.262 --> 00:01:16.452
Specialty tools are built in, too.

16
00:01:16.892 --> 00:01:21.302
Dental: findings and treatment plan on the odontogram.

17
00:01:21.592 --> 00:01:25.242
Eye care: visual acuity and refraction.

18
00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:31.612
Dermatology: mark the site on a body map and compare photos over time.

19
00:01:31.912 --> 00:01:37.152
Children's health: growth charts, vaccinations, screening.

20
00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:43.035
Digital prescriptions with medicine details; each one stays on record.

21
00:01:44.709 --> 00:01:51.979
Pharmacy: batch, expiry, stock, alerts — first to expire, first dispensed.

22
00:01:52.439 --> 00:01:58.649
Lab: from sample to result and the doctor's review — without paper.

23
00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:04.949
Referrals: specialists, external partners — every one can be tracked.

24
00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:12.980
Billing: invoices, applicable GST, every payment method, receipts and balances.

25
00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:20.920
At day end, payments and refunds are reconciled; a clear financial picture with GST reports.

26
00:02:21.317 --> 00:02:24.482
Many clinics, one platform, combined reports.

27
00:02:24.502 --> 00:02:26.746
Welbuk Cloud is available today.

28
00:02:26.766 --> 00:02:29.719
Need on-premises, hybrid or air-gapped AI?

29
00:02:29.739 --> 00:02:30.617
Let's talk.

30
00:02:31.204 --> 00:02:38.784
For the staff: staff records, attendance, leave management, role-based permissions.

31
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:48.421
After the visit, Welbuk Health stays connected: visit history, prescriptions, reports, reminders, follow-ups.

32
00:02:48.997 --> 00:02:55.267
Family health in one place: guardian links, vaccinations, growth tracking.

33
00:02:55.557 --> 00:03:05.567
Looking ahead, our goal: a trusted network joining clinics, specialists, pharmacies and labs — sharing only with the patient's permission.

34
00:03:05.997 --> 00:03:06.699
Welbuk.

35
00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:12.060
Doctors care for patients; Welbuk cares for doctors.

36
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.067
For a free demo, welbuk.com.

